# s8_encrypt_chunk: embedding encrypted in eight slices (its three simultaneous copies 1/8 each). Phase B.
#
# object     found on the clock: s7's peak 1,080,140 kB vs highest phase marker 393,464 (2.7x). Poller:
#              embed|after_convert     393,464 kB      t = -1,416 ms
#              POLLER MAXIMUM          995,076 kB      t =      0
#              embed|after_encrypt     320,360 kB      t =   +288 ms
#            peak inside one enc_embed.encrypt() call, a 601,612 kB transient (= anon:residual, 711.6 MB,
#            64.3% of s7's peak).
# arithmetic one parameter's encryption holds plaintext (94 MB float32), int64 share (187 MB), mask share
#            (187 MB) and send share (187 MB): ~570 MB; measured 601,612 kB.
# donor      retired SHAFT_ENC_CHUNKS (08_low_cpu_mem_load/bert_instrumented.py); its s6_stream_load
#            config: SHAFT_EMBED_CHUNKS 8, SHAFT_ENC_CHUNKS 8 (endpoint 643,784 kB). That 643,784 is a
#            100 ms VmRSS poller maximum (its log: poller 643784 kB, markers 476896 kB); ours is VmHWM.
#            Like for like: s7 poller maximum 904,944 vs 643,784.
# order      encrypt_chunk_cpu before encrypt_spill_cpu (the spill captures Module.encrypt at import);
#            the lever refuses at import otherwise.
# free       same bytes, same plaintext, same order, one slice at a time.
# phase B    crypten.cryptensor(x, src=0) broadcasts per slice (same bytes, more rounds). Condition (b):
#            impl/equiv_encrypt_chunk.py (split bit-identical; chunked within one fixed-point unit at
#            N = 2, 4, 8, 16).
# scope      threshold 5,000,000 elements: only the embedding (22.3M; next 2.36M); count reported.
# expected   transient ~600 -> ~75 MB, peak ~500,000 kB vs 1,080,140 (~-50%). Much higher = second
#            transient source; next action a finer poll.
SHAFT_SCRIPT=$BASE/bert_perlayer_stream_cpu.py
SHAFT_LEVERS=plaintext_free_cpu,triple_share_free_cpu,trace_nograd_cpu,onnx_single_file_export_cpu,encrypt_chunk_cpu,encrypt_spill_cpu,embed_chunk_cpu
SHAFT_INNER_ENV="SHAFT_EMBED_CHUNKS=16 SHAFT_ENC_CHUNKS=8"
